        "@value": "About E.A.T. projects: a Getty podcast episode on Fujiko Nakaya, with her recorded recollections of performing in Deborah Hay's Solo at 9 Evenings and of making the fog sculpture for the Pepsi Pavilion with the engineer Thomas Mee."
      }
    ]
  },
