      {
        "@value": "E.A.T.-adjacent: Audrey Sabol recalls how Billy Kl\u00fcver, a Bell Labs scientist, guided her and Joan Kron of the Philadelphia Y Arts Council to \u00d6yvind Fahlstr\u00f6m, Roy Lichtenstein, Jim Dine, Claes Oldenburg and other New York artists."
      }
