    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "E.A.T.-adjacent: Gyorgy Kepes recalls making the film of L\u00e1szl\u00f3 Moholy-Nagy's light machine with him in Berlin, his doubts about such work, and says he came to accept the technological world only at MIT, on meeting the sciences there."
      }
