      {
        "@value": "E.A.T.-adjacent: Stephen Antonakos explains how he timed the programmed sequences of his early neon sculptures, built by his friend Norman Dolff, and recalls light-art shows: Sound, Light, Silence in Kansas City and the Walker's light show."
