    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "About E.A.T.: Alice Denney on Robert Rauschenberg and Billy Kl\u00fcver each claiming E.A.T. as his idea, their visit to her NOW Festival, and Kl\u00fcver's claim to the idea of a record she made with him."
      }
    ]
