    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "About E.A.T.: Patty Mucha says she missed 9 Evenings (1966), being in Sweden and London with Claes Oldenburg, knows it from Julie Martin's videos, and admires Rauschenberg's Open Score with Frank Stella's tennis game."
      }
