        "@value": "E.A.T.-adjacent: Laddie John Dill recalls an outdoor light collaboration with Robert Rauschenberg on a Los Angeles hill: Rauschenberg's two facing klieg lights and Dill's neon and argon tubes buried in holes."
      }
    ]
  },
